# s5: s4 with every input off the plane (z=-1). Left pullers level-held (lv), right pullers pulsed late
# (r), BR's puller late (b), B level (bb), A: push+hold 1..5 (open), top pull 11..13 (open), close push
# 3..5; U 4 / 10 and K 8 on both edges (c79's ticks).
